@startuml SD_RecordRedistributionComplete
title UC-F05 - Record Redistribution Completion
hide footbox
autonumber
actor Operator
boundary "Redistribution UI" as UI
control "RedistributionController" as C
entity "AssignmentRepository" as A
entity "VehicleRepository" as V
entity "HubRepository" as H

Operator -> UI: Open incomplete assignment
UI -> C: getAssignment(assignmentId)
C -> A: findById(assignmentId)
A --> C: Assignment and arrival records
C --> UI: Assigned vehicles and destination
Operator -> UI: Confirm arrived vehicle IDs
UI -> C: recordArrival(assignmentId, arrivedIds)
C -> A: Reload assignment with current version
alt Missing or already completed
  A --> C: Invalid state
  C --> UI: Show current status; no changes
else Assignment is incomplete
  A --> C: Current assignment
  loop Each confirmed vehicle ID
    C -> V: Verify assigned identity and current location
    V --> C: Vehicle state
  end
  alt Mismatched, duplicate, or unverified arrival
    C --> UI: Reject invalid confirmation; allow correction
  else All confirmed arrivals are valid
    C -> H: Check destination capacity and occupancy
    H --> C: Current Hub counts
    C -> A: Begin atomic completion update
    loop Each newly confirmed vehicle
      C -> V: Set location to destination Hub
      C -> H: Update source/destination occupancy once
      C -> A: Mark vehicle arrived
    end
    alt All assigned vehicles have arrived
      C -> A: Set assignment Completed
    else Some assigned vehicles have not arrived
      C -> A: Set assignment PartiallyCompleted
    end
    alt Any update fails
      A --> C: Roll back all changes
      C --> UI: Completion not recorded
    else Update commits
      A --> C: New assignment state and version
      C --> UI: Show confirmed arrivals and remaining vehicles
      UI --> Operator: Display completion result
    end
  end
end
note over C,H
Only newly confirmed arrivals change location and occupancy.
Retries do not double-count the same vehicle (FR-NI-05).
end note
@enduml
